  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Creating a Filter with CHAT\r\n\r\n**Context**: You are developing a Music App to curate playlists and need to incorporate a filter algorithm.\r\n\r\n### 1. Clarify\r\nIn `CHAT-Prompt.md`, decompose the type of filters that you might need to build for this music app.\r\n\r\n### 2. Hone\r\nUse AI Tutor to assist with writing the helper functions necessary to implement the filters.\r\n\r\n### 3. Apply\r\nImplement your solution into the code and test its functionality. Have AI Tutor assist with creating test cases to make sure that all of your data is being filtered properly.\r\n\r\n### 4. Transfer\r\nCreate a generalized prompt to implement a simple filter into future work. Save it into the backpack.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
